Student Enrollments

Tables:
students, enrollments, courses, departments

Question:
Retrieve student_id, name, course_id, and
running_enrollments_count (number of courses enrolled by that
student up to and including the current course based on course_id).

QUERY:

SELECT
    s.student_id,
    s.name,
    e.course_id,
    COUNT(*) OVER (
        PARTITION BY e.student_id
        ORDER BY e.course_id
    ) AS running_enrollments_count
FROM students s
JOIN enrollments e
    ON s.student_id = e.student_id
JOIN courses c
    ON e.course_id = c.course_id
JOIN departments d
    ON c.department_id = d.department_id
ORDER BY s.student_id, e.course_id;


