QUESTION 2 — SQL
============================================================

Hospital Appointments

Tables:
patients, departments, doctors, appointments

Question:
Retrieve status, appointment_id, appointment_date,
patient_name, doctor_name, and department_name.

QUERY:

SELECT
    a.status,
    a.appointment_id,
    a.appointment_date,
    p.patient_name,
    d.doctor_name,
    dept.department_name
FROM appointments a
JOIN patients p
    ON a.patient_id = p.patient_id
JOIN doctors d
    ON a.doctor_id = d.doctor_id
JOIN departments dept
    ON d.department_id = dept.department_id;


